      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "新聞專用前後頁與直接選頁，保留結果範圍狀態及首末頁停用；原共用 Pagination 不替換。新聞桌面的 rem 與整個新聞框架共用單一根基準：clamp(100%, calc(100vw * 16 / 1127), 150%)，預設16px、上限24px；其他路由及手機維持原基準。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-news-pagination\" aria-label=\"分頁導覽\"><p class=\"ds-news-pagination-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">顯示第 1–3 筆，共 7 筆</p><button class=\"ds-news-pagination-button\" type=\"button\" disabled aria-label=\"前往上一頁\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg><span>上一頁</span></button><select class=\"ds-news-pagination-select\" aria-label=\"選擇新聞頁碼\"><option selected>第 1 頁，共 3 頁</option><option>第 2 頁，共 3 頁</option><option>第 3 頁，共 3 頁</option></select><button class=\"ds-news-pagination-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"前往下一頁\"><span>下一頁</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-news-pagination{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:var(--spacing-2);border-top:1px solid var(--color-border-light);padding-top:var(--spacing-2);font-family:var(--font-data);font-size:0.875rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-news-pagination-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--spacing-1);flex-shrink:0;min-height:var(--spacing-11);padding:0 var(--spacing-3);border:1px solid var(--color-border-light);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--color-background-card);color:var(--color-text-muted);font:inherit}.ds-news-pagination-select{min-width:0;min-height:var(--spacing-11);appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:transparent;color:var(--color-text-secondary);padding:0 var(--spacing-2);font:inherit;text-align:center}.ds-news-pagination-button:hover{background:var(--color-background-surface)}.ds-news-pagination-button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:0.4}.ds-news-pagination-button:focus-visible,.ds-news-pagination-select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:2px}.ds-news-pagination-status{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(min-width:1024px) and (pointer:fine){.ds-news-pagination{padding-top:var(--spacing-1)}.ds-news-pagination-button,.ds-news-pagination-select{min-height:var(--spacing-8);border-radius:calc(var(--radius-sm)/2)}}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-news-pagination-button span{display:none}}"
    }
